OL,3,ACanada becoming EU 'associate member'
OL,4,Awould be positive move, Carney says,
OL,5,Aafter Trump criticism
OL,6,
OL,7,FPM Mark Carney says he "welcomes" the
OL,8,FEU's "ambition" for Canada to become an
OL,9,Fassociate member, in a speech to the
OL,10,FEuropean Parliament - here's what else
OL,11,Fwe heard
OL,13,FSpeaking to reporters afterwards,
OL,14,FCarney says a closer alliance with the
OL,15,FEU is a "positive process", and it
OL,16,Fwould make his country a "more
OL,17,Feffective partner" of the US and the EU
